<h2 id="configuring-emacs-for-sending-mail">Configuring Emacs for sending mail</h2>
<p>I use mu4e, but I think the <code>smtpmail-*</code> variables are also used by <code>gnus</code> and <code>notmuch</code> for sending mail—I could be wrong though, so if I am, someone please correct me. :)</p>
<p>I use the following in my mu4e <a class="link-external" rel="external" href="https://www.djcbsoftware.nl/code/mu/mu4e/Contexts.html">work context</a>; adjust as needed:</p>
<pre class="giallo" style="color: #D8DEE9; background-color: #2E3440;"><code data-lang="emacs-lisp"><span class="giallo-l"><span style="color: #ECEFF4;">(</span><span>make-mu4e-context</span></span>
<span class="giallo-l"><span style="color: #ECEFF4;"> :</span><span>name</span><span style="color: #ECEFF4;"> &quot;</span><span style="color: #A3BE8C;">Work</span><span style="color: #ECEFF4;">&quot;</span></span>
<span class="giallo-l"><span style="color: #ECEFF4;"> :</span><span>match-func</span></span>
<span class="giallo-l"><span style="color: #ECEFF4;"> (</span><span style="color: #81A1C1;">lambda</span><span style="color: #ECEFF4;"> (</span><span>msg</span><span style="color: #ECEFF4;">)</span></span>
<span class="giallo-l"><span style="color: #ECEFF4;">   (</span><span style="color: #81A1C1;">when</span><span> msg</span></span>
<span class="giallo-l"><span style="color: #ECEFF4;">     (</span><span style="color: #88C0D0;">string-prefix-p</span><span style="color: #ECEFF4;"> &quot;</span><span style="color: #A3BE8C;">/Umail</span><span style="color: #ECEFF4;">&quot; (</span><span>mu4e-message-field msg </span><span style="color: #ECEFF4;">:</span><span>maildir</span><span style="color: #ECEFF4;">))))</span></span>
<span class="giallo-l"><span style="color: #ECEFF4;"> :</span><span>vars</span></span>
<span class="giallo-l"><span style="color: #ECEFF4;"> &#39;((</span><span style="color: #88C0D0;">user-mail-address</span><span style="color: #81A1C1;"> .</span><span style="color: #ECEFF4;"> &quot;</span><span style="color: #A3BE8C;">ashton.wiersdorf@utah.edu</span><span style="color: #ECEFF4;">&quot;)</span></span>
<span class="giallo-l"><span style="color: #ECEFF4;">   (</span><span style="color: #88C0D0;">user-full-name</span><span style="color: #81A1C1;"> .</span><span style="color: #ECEFF4;"> &quot;</span><span style="color: #A3BE8C;">Ashton Wiersdorf</span><span style="color: #ECEFF4;">&quot;)</span></span>
